{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.SumSYTEqInvolution","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.SumSYTEqInvolution","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.YoungLatticeCornerCount","lean:module:QOU.Mass.InvolutionNumbers","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.RSKBurnsideTarget","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedPartitionShape"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.sum_dimSYT_eq_involution_keystone","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.sum_dimSYT_eq_involution_keystone","kind":"theorem","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L171-L177","doc":"**`RSKIdentitiesContext.sum_dimSYT_eq_involution`'s exact statement.**  Kept as a named\nalias because that field is stated over `Nat.Partition` while the theorem above is the natural\nform; they are now literally the same proposition, since `KeystoneC8SuperExpBound` no longer\ncarries its own copy of `involutionNumber`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.sum_dimSYT_eq_involutionNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.sum_dimSYT_eq_involutionNumber","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L160-L169","doc":"The same identity indexed by `Nat.Partition n` rather than by sized diagrams — the shape\n`RSKIdentitiesContext.sum_dimSYT_eq_involution` is stated in.  `dimSYT p` is by definition\n`#SYT (partitionShape p)`, and `partitionShapeEquiv` matches the two index types. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.sum_numSYT_eq_card_involutions","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.sum_numSYT_eq_card_involutions","kind":"theorem","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L151-L158","doc":"**The Robinson–Schensted corollary**: the sum of SYT counts over the shapes of size `n`\nis the number of involutions in `S_n`.  Obtained by composing\n`sum_numSYT_eq_involutionNumber` with `card_involutions_eq_involutionNumber`, neither of\nwhich counts involutions by tableaux — so the identity is not circular. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.sum_numSYT_eq_involutionNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.sum_numSYT_eq_involutionNumber","kind":"theorem","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L135-L149","doc":"**`∑_{λ ⊢ n} f^λ = I(n)`.**  Sorry-free, and without RSK: the left side satisfies the\ninvolution recurrence by the differential-poset structure of Young's lattice\n(`QOU.Mathlib.sum_numSYT_recurrence'`), the right side by definition, and the two base\ncases match. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.sum_numSYT_size_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.sum_numSYT_size_one","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L112-L127","doc":"`s(1) = 1`.  Read off the rank-`0` case of `sum_numSYT_succ_split`: the corner-weighted\nterm vanishes because `⊥` has no removable corner. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.sum_numSYT_size_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.sum_numSYT_size_zero","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L96-L110","doc":"`s(0) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.cornerCells_bot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.cornerCells_bot","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L87-L92","doc":"The empty diagram has no removable corner. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.eq_bot_of_card_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.eq_bot_of_card_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L83-L85","doc":"A diagram with no cells is the empty diagram. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.numStandardYoungTableaux_bot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.numStandardYoungTableaux_bot","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L78-L81","doc":"`#SYT(∅) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.instNonemptyStandardYoungTableauBotYoungDiagram","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.instNonemptyStandardYoungTableauBotYoungDiagram","kind":"instance","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L70-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.botSsyt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.botSsyt","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L62-L68","doc":"The unique semistandard tableau of the empty shape: every entry is `0`, and both the row\nand column conditions are vacuous because no cell is in `⊥`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.instSubsingletonStandardYoungTableauBotYoungDiagram","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.instSubsingletonStandardYoungTableauBotYoungDiagram","kind":"instance","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SumSYTEqInvolution.lean#L53-L60","signatureChunk":0}]}